---
// Top disclaimer bar ensuring strict compliance
---
<aside aria-label="免责声明" class="bg-amber-500/10 border-b border-amber-500/20 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-semibold text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300">
        客观性原则
      </span>
      <span>
        本站聚合数据均注明<strong>原始出处与快照时间</strong>。各榜单测试方法与评价维度差异显著，<strong>严禁跨榜混排或加权汇总</strong>，排名仅供技术选型参考。
      </span>
    </div>
    <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/about`} class="underline font-medium hover:text-amber-950 dark:hover:text-amber-100 shrink-0">
      阅读数据合规与免责协议 &rarr;
    </a>
  </div>
</aside>
